#: main.cpp:42
msgid "Install, list, remove Plasma packages"
msgstr "Pakêtên Plasmayê sazbike, lîste bike, rake"

#: main.cpp:77
msgid "Plasma Package Manager"
msgstr "Gerînendeyê Pakêtên Plasmayê"

#: main.cpp:79
msgid "(C) 2008, Aaron Seigo"
msgstr "(C) 2008, Aaron Seigo"

#: main.cpp:80
msgid "Aaron Seigo"
msgstr "Aaron Seigo"

#: main.cpp:81
msgid "Original author"
msgstr "Nivîskarê yekemîn"

#: main.cpp:90
msgid "For install or remove, operates on packages installed for all users."
msgstr ""
"Ji bo sazkirin û rakirinê, ji bo hemû bikarhêneran li ser pakêtên sazbûyî "
"dixebite."

#: main.cpp:96
msgctxt ""
"theme, wallpaper, etc. are keywords, but they may be translated, as both "
"versions are recognized by the application (if translated, should be same as "
"messages with 'package type' context below)"
msgid ""
"The type of package, e.g. theme, wallpaper, plasmoid, dataengine, runner, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"Cureyê pakêtê, her wekî, dirb, rûerd, plasmoid, MotoraDaneyan, ajoker, hwd."

#: main.cpp:100
msgctxt "Do not translate <path>"
msgid "Install the package at <path>"
msgstr "Pakêtê di <path> de saz bike"

#: main.cpp:102
msgctxt "Do not translate <path>"
msgid "Upgrade the package at <path>"
msgstr "Pakêtê di <path> de bilind bike"

#: main.cpp:104
msgid "List installed packages"
msgstr "Pakêtên sazbûyî lîste bike"

#: main.cpp:106
msgctxt "Do not translate <name>"
msgid "Remove the package named <name>"
msgstr "Pakêta bi navê <name> rake"

#: main.cpp:108
msgid ""
"Absolute path to the package root. If not supplied, then the standard data "
"directories for this KDE session will be searched instead."
msgstr ""
"Riya roota a pakêtê a tam. Heke neyê zanîn, dê ji dêvla wê vepelrêçên "
"agahiyên standard ên ji bo vê danişîna KDE'yê bê geriyan."

#: main.cpp:120
msgctxt "package type"
msgid "plasmoid"
msgstr "plasmoid"

#: main.cpp:124
msgctxt "package type"
msgid "theme"
msgstr "dirb"

#: main.cpp:126
msgctxt "package type"
msgid "wallpaper"
msgstr "rûerd"

#: main.cpp:128
msgctxt "package type"
msgid "dataengine"
msgstr "morotadaneyan"

#: main.cpp:132
msgctxt "package type"
msgid "runner"
msgstr "xebatkar"

#: main.cpp:140
#, kde-format
msgid "Could not find a suitable installer for package of type %1"
msgstr "Nikare ji bo pakêta %1 sazkarekê lêhatî bibîne"

#: main.cpp:149
#, kde-format
msgid "Could not load installer for package of type %1. Error reported was: %2"
msgstr "Ji bo cureyê %1 a pakêtê sazkar nehat barkirin. Rapora çewtiyê: %2"

#: main.cpp:167
msgctxt ""
"The user entered conflicting options packageroot and global, this is the "
"error message telling the user he can use only one"
msgid ""
"The packageroot and global options conflict each other, please select only "
"one."
msgstr ""

#: main.cpp:207
#, kde-format
msgid "Successfully removed %1"
msgstr "Rakirina %1 biserket"

#: main.cpp:209
#, kde-format
msgid "Removal of %1 failed."
msgstr "Rakirina %1 têk çû."

#: main.cpp:214
#, kde-format
msgid "Plugin %1 is not installed."
msgstr "Pêveka %1 nehat saz kirin."

#: main.cpp:219
#, kde-format
msgid "Successfully installed %1"
msgstr "Sazkirina %1 biserket"

#: main.cpp:221
#, kde-format
msgid "Installation of %1 failed."
msgstr "Sazkirina %1 têk çû."

#: main.cpp:227
msgctxt ""
"No option was given, this is the error message telling the user he needs at "
"least one, do not translate install, remove, upgrade nor list"
msgid "One of install, remove, upgrade or list is required."
msgstr "An sazkirin, an rakirin, an jî lîste kirin pêwist e."

#: rc.cpp:1
msgctxt "NAME OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your names"
msgstr "Erdal Ronahi, Amed Çeko Jiyan"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgctxt "EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your emails"
msgstr "erdal dot ronahi at gmail dot com, amedcj at gmail dot com"
